= Phonology
*Consonants.* p · t · k · s · m · n · l · r

*Vowels.* a · i · u

*Syllable structure.* CV, CVC

*Phonotactics.*
- no geminate (doubled) consonants
- clusters at most 2 segment(s) long

*Allophony.*
- `t > s / _ i`
- `n > m / _ p`

*Stress.* penultimate — the second-to-last syllable

= Morphology
*Affixes.*
/ *DAT*: `ti` #emph[Suffix]
/ *PL*: `u` #emph[Suffix]

*Derivation.*
- *agent*: verb → noun via `ar`

